window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>The chase is on! A vivacious American has resolved to hunt for the perfect man—literally.</i></b><br> <br> Call me Sabrina Remington, man hunter. I’m determined to find the perfect guy. But my international manhunt has been a bust so far.<br> <br> Then I bump into a sexy Brit whose voice melts my panties. Until the jerk opens his mouth. Every word Declan Wilde speaks is rude. I should slap him and walk away.<br> <br> But maybe I could put up with that mouth for one steamy night…<br> <br> As soon as Declan falls asleep, I slink out of the hotel. Our fling is over…right?<br> <br> Well, not quite…<br> <br> Now the hot jerk has set his sights on hunting for <i>me</i>.<br> <br> <b><i>One Hot Chase</i></b><b> is the twelfth book in the Hot Brits series of romantic comedy.</b></p>"; 
